{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_PROMETHEUS",
      "label": "Prometheus",
      "description": "",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus",
      "pluginName": "Prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    }
  ],
  "description": "KIZASHI service health scores — P5 (not yet implemented, panels show placeholder queries)",
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "id": null,
  "links": [
    {
      "title": "Predictive Dashboard",
      "url": "/d/kizashi-predictive",
      "type": "link",
      "icon": "external link",
      "targetBlank": false
    }
  ],
  "refresh": "1m",
  "schemaVersion": 36,
  "tags": ["kizashi", "network", "health-score"],
  "time": { "from": "now-3h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "timezone": "browser",
  "title": "KIZASHI — Service Health Scores (P5)",
  "uid": "kizashi-health",
  "version": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "current": {},
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": false,
        "name": "datasource",
        "options": [],
        "query": "prometheus",
        "refresh": 1,
        "type": "datasource",
        "label": "Datasource"
      },
      {
        "current": {},
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
        "definition": "label_values(kizashi_health_score, service)",
        "hide": 0,
        "includeAll": true,
        "allValue": ".*",
        "label": "Service",
        "multi": true,
        "name": "service",
        "query": { "query": "label_values(kizashi_health_score, service)", "refId": "V" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query"
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "content": "## P5 — Service Health Score (not yet implemented)\n\nThis dashboard will show `kizashi_health_score` once **P5** is complete.\n\n**Planned panels:**\n- Current health score gauge per service (0 = down, 100 = healthy)\n- Health score trend over time\n- 1-hour-ahead forecast health score\n- Drilldown table: which device / interface is pulling the score down\n\nUntil then, the panels below display placeholder queries that return no data.\nSee [KIZASHI design doc §6](https://github.com/itanaka66/KIZASHI/blob/main/docs/design.md#6-サービスヘルススコア) for the full specification.",
      "datasource": null,
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "id": 1,
      "options": { "mode": "markdown" },
      "title": "",
      "transparent": true,
      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "id": 10,
      "title": "Current Health",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Current service health score. 100 = fully healthy, 0 = critical. Implemented in P5.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red",    "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 40 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 60 },
              { "color": "green",  "value": 80 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "noValue": "P5 not yet implemented"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 6 },
      "id": 2,
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "kizashi_health_score{service=~\"$service\", horizon=\"0\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Health Score Now",
      "type": "gauge"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Predicted health score 1 hour from now, derived from failure probability (P5).",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "red",    "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 40 },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 60 },
              { "color": "green",  "value": 80 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "noValue": "P5 not yet implemented"
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 6 },
      "id": 3,
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"], "fields": "", "values": false },
        "orientation": "auto",
        "showThresholdLabels": false,
        "showThresholdMarkers": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "kizashi_health_score{service=~\"$service\", horizon=\"1h\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}} (1h forecast)",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Health Score Forecast (+1h)",
      "type": "gauge"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 14 },
      "id": 11,
      "title": "Health Score Trend",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Health score over time per service. The shaded area below 60 highlights the degraded zone.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 5,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "area" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "transparent", "value": null },
              { "color": "transparent", "value": 60 }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100
        }
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 15 },
      "id": 4,
      "options": {
        "legend": { "calcs": ["mean", "min", "last"], "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "asc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "kizashi_health_score{service=~\"$service\", horizon=\"0\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{service}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "title": "Health Score Over Time",
      "type": "timeseries"
    },
    {
      "collapsed": false,
      "gridPos": { "h": 1, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 24 },
      "id": 12,
      "title": "Root Cause Drilldown",
      "type": "row"
    },
    {
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
      "description": "Top contributors pulling the health score down — the devices and interfaces with the highest anomaly scores within the selected services.",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "custom": { "width": 0 },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green",  "value": null },
              { "color": "yellow", "value": 3 },
              { "color": "red",    "value": 6 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Anomaly Score" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.displayMode", "value": "color-background" },
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 140 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 25 },
      "id": 5,
      "options": {
        "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "Anomaly Score", "desc": true }],
        "footer": { "show": false }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "${datasource}" },
          "expr": "topk(20, kizashi_anomaly_score{layer=\"baseline\"})",
          "instant": true,
          "legendFormat": "",
          "refId": "A",
          "format": "table"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "renameByName": {
              "instance": "Instance",
              "ifName": "Interface",
              "metric": "Metric",
              "Value": "Anomaly Score"
            },
            "excludeByName": {
              "Time": true,
              "__name__": true,
              "layer": true,
              "job": true
            }
          }
        }
      ],
      "title": "Top Contributing Anomalies",
      "type": "table"
    }
  ]
}
